Package: bodycon
Title: Estimation of Animal Body Condition Indices
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Julia", "Riley", , "jriley@mta.ca", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7691-6910")),
    person("Fonti", "Kar", role = c("aut", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2760-3974"))
    )
Description: Provides functions for calculating and visualizing body condition indices for animals. Methods include residual-based ordinary least squares (OLS) indices, the scaled mass index (SMI) using classical standardized major axis (SMA) regression, and the SMI using robust SMA regression, along with visualizations for comparing these approaches.
